599,"buyTimeRel":82.06811667984118},{"itemId":"800008313","matches":14324,"winRate":57.602624965093554,"buyTimeRel":70.13631411645189}]},"abilities":[{"id":"2840115251","name":"Melee","nameRu":"Ближний бой","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/melee_damage.png","className":"citadel_ability_melee_tengu","description":"","abilityType":"melee"},{"id":"1531378655","name":"Kudzu Connection","nameRu":"Кудзу-связь","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/tengu/tengu_tether.png","className":"citadel_ability_tangotether","description":"Connect with a nearby ally to gain bonuses, <span class=\"highlight\">replicated healing,</span> and ignore the move speed penalty while shooting.<br><span class=\"diminish\"><br>Receive 50% of Bonuses with no connection<br>Connection requires line of sight.</span> ","descriptionRu":"Плющик соединяется лозой с союзником поблизости, что даёт бонусы, <span class=\"highlight\">дублируемое лечение</span> и избавляет от замедления при стрельбе.<br><span class=\"diminish\"><br>При отсутствии соединения Плющик получает вдвое меньшие бонусы.<br>Для соединения цель должна находиться в вашем поле зрения.</span> ","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"4111222521","name":"Entangling Thorns","nameRu":"Опутывающие терния","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/tengu/tengu_storm_flask.png","className":"citadel_ability_tengu_urn","description":"Summon a patch of choking thorns that <span class=\"highlight\">damages</span> and <span class=\"highlight\">slows</span> enemies in its radius.","descriptionRu":"Плющик создаёт участок с терниями, которые <span class=\"highlight\">наносят урон</span> попавшимся врагам и <span class=\"highlight\">замедляют</span> их.","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"3642273386","name":"Stone Form","nameRu":"Каменный облик","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/tengu/tengu_stone_form.png","className":"citadel_ability_tengu_stone_form","description":"Turn yourself into <span class=\"highlight\">impervious stone</span> and smash into the ground, <span class=\"highlight\">stunning and damaging</span> enemies nearby. Heals you for a percentage of your max health.","descriptionRu":"Плющик превращается в <span class=\"highlight\">непробиваемый камень</span> и врезается в землю, <span class=\"highlight\">нанося урон и оглушая</span> врагов поблизости. Умение лечит на процент от макс. здоровья.","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"1247583368","name":"Air Drop","nameRu":"Поддержка с воздуха","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/tengu/tengu_lightning_crash.png","className":"citadel_ability_tengu_airlift","description":"<span class=\"highlight\">Grab an ally</span> and <span class=\"highlight\">take flight</span> with them. Drop your ally to cause an explosion, dealing <svg width=\"128\" height=\"128\" viewBox=\"0 0 128 128\" fill=\"white\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M53.7875 20.0238C48.6533 13.3022 40.8042 9 32.0027 9C16.5345 9 4 22.2789 4 38.6558C4 38.7707 4.00052 38.8854 4.00155 39H91.8416L94.7229 33.1618C97.2906 27.9591 104.71 27.9591 107.277 33.1618L110.159 39H115.998C115.999 38.8854 116 38.7707 116 38.6558C116 22.2789 103.466 9 87.9973 9C79.1958 9 71.3467 13.3022 66.2125 20.0238C65.7565 20.6214 65.336 21.1783 64.9462 21.6946C62.4734 24.9699 61.2367 26.6078 59.9993 26.6084C58.7614 26.609 57.5227 24.9711 55.0449 21.6946C54.6545 21.1783 54.2333 20.6214 53.7766 20.0238H53.7875Z\" fill=\"white\"/>\n<path d=\"M79.7015 79L79.5588 79.8323C78.7516 84.5386 82.6742 88.3253 86.9508 88.0132C86.8571 88.1111 86.7634 88.209 86.6696 88.3069C78.1991 97.1552 69.4174 106.328 62.6218 116.742C61.1111 119.051 58.8889 119.051 57.3782 116.742C50.5788 106.325 41.7966 97.1509 33.3264 88.303C30.3317 85.1748 27.3761 82.0873 24.5608 79H79.7015Z\" fill=\"white\"/>\n<path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"eveno